Francia, ognuno per motivi differenti. Gli uomini vogliono portare insieme a loro anche le rispettive spose e i bambini, ma i due genitori non possono concepire la loro vita lontano dalle figliole e sono decisi a fare qualsiasi cosa pur di trattenere i quattro mariti."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Serial (Bad) Weddings 2","overview":"Claude and Marie Verneuil face a new crisis. The four spouses of their daughters, David, Rachid, Chao and Charles decided to leave France for various reasons. Here they are imagining their lives elsewhere."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Le retour des familles Verneuil et Koffi au grand complet ! Claude et Marie Verneuil font face à une nouvelle crise. Leurs quatre gendres, Rachid, David, Chao et Charles sont décidés à quitter la France avec femmes et enfants pour tenter leur chance à l’étranger. Incapables d’imaginer leur famille loin d’eux, Claude et Marie sont prêts à tout pour les retenir. De leur côté, les Koffi débarquent en France pour le mariage de leur fille. Eux non plus ne sont pas au bout de leurs surprises…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vhNpVr2pIWK3UBVOKZjGMC8SFDK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/co1ItuquxZjxLqbjjCLwK9ADkS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":505436,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vhNpVr2pIWK3UBVOKZjGMC8SFDK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vhNpVr2pIWK3UBVOKZjGMC8SFDK.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vhNpVr2pIWK3UBVOKZjGMC8SFDK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vhNpVr2pIWK3UBVOKZjGMC8SFDK.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7HdmTxmefeL4